{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10455","headline":"送郭处士往莱芜兼寄苟山人 · 高适","name":"送郭处士往莱芜兼寄苟山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君爲东蒙客，往来东蒙畔。\n云卧临峄阳，山行穷日观。\n少年词赋皆可听，秀眉白面风清泠。\n身上未曾染名利，口中犹未知膻腥。\n今日还山意无极，岂辞世路多相识。\n归见莱芜九十翁，爲论别後长相忆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}